        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/screenshot-from-subnautica-2-showing-a-character-with-a-cracked-diving-mask.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/subnautica-2\">Subnautica 2</a>, like its predecessors, has a strong theme of pacifism running through it. Rather than killing aggressive fish, the game instead provides tools for players to avoid or distract creatures to save their own hides. Now that the Unknown Worlds&rsquo; controversial sequel has launched, however, this dedication to non-violence has proven frustrating to a subset of the community.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/subnautica-2-self-defence-fish-fighting\">Read more</a></p>",
