        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/nex_playground.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Nex Playground, the family-focused and camera-based console that's had considerable success in the US, is about to be released in the UK and Ireland. Pre-orders begin today at <a href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/Nex-Playground-Active-Play-System/dp/B0GT2HWPJC/\">Amazon</a>, Argos and <a href=\"https://www.smythstoys.com/uk/en-gb/gaming-and-tech/nex-playground/nex-playground-console-the-active-play-system-for-kids-and-families/p/262774\">Smyths Toys</a>, and the Nex Playground will launch at an unspecified point in late June.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/nex-playground-uk-release-date\">Read more</a></p>",
